{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": ""}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Physical to Digital"}, {"type": "position", "content": 2}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 2}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear/use when you talk about converting from physical to digital formats:"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Identify key information about people's jobs and places of work in spoken or written contexts.  Identify and recognize information related to concepts about graphic design related to IT."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.   Exchanges simple information on the design of an information system, computer architecture and hardware, and basic concepts on graphic design."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "enpe8n4le02ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Superlatives (Short Adjectives)"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You can use <span class=\"strong\">superlatives</span> to talk about a noun that has a highly developed quality."}, {"type": "text", "content": "In order to use <span class=\"strong\">superlatives</span> with <span class=\"strong\">short adjectives</span>, you need to use the definite article <span class=\"strong\">the</span>, and the adjective with the <span class=\"strong\">-est</span> suffix. <br /><br /> Remember, <span class=\"strong\">short adjectives</span> have only one or two syllables."}, {"type": "text", "content": " Examples:<br /> <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">The fastest</span> design programs are very expensive.</span><br /> <span class=\"italic\">Digital tools offer <span class=\"strong\">the simplest</span> approach to information design.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Some two-syllable adjectives can also take <span class=\"strong\">the Most</span> to form the <span class=\"strong\">superlative</span>.<br /><br /> Examples:<br /> <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">The simplest</span> systems offer great reliability.</span><br /> <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">The most simple</span> systems offer great reliability.</span><br />"}, {"type": "text", "content": "There are exceptions to create <span class=\"strong\">superlatives</span> in some common adjectives. <br /><br /> Examples: <br /> <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">The best</span> way to spread information is online.</span><br /> <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">The worst</span> scenario is if you lose the physical information.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Sometimes the hardest part is moving from a physical format to a digital one. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Definitely, we'll make the prettiest animation using all the tools in this program."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Compound Adjectives"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Compound adjectives</span> usually put two simple <span class=\"strong\">adjectives</span> together to form a new word with a different meaning.  "}, {"type": "text", "content": "In order to use <span class=\"strong\">compound adjectives</span>, you need two or more of them and you need to use hyphens <span class=\"strong\">(-)</span> in order to avoid confusions, because without the <span class=\"strong\">hyphens</span>, each <span class=\"strong\">adjective</span> looks as a single word."}, {"type": "text", "content": " Examples:<br />  <span class=\"italic\">Digital technologies are very <span class=\"strong\">well-known</span> nowadays.</span><br />  <span class=\"italic\">Physical information has become <span class=\"strong\">old-fashioned</span>.</span><br /> "}, {"type": "text", "content": " You will find some extra examples of compound adjectives in the chart below."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":8,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Compound adjective</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"World-famous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Recognized, renowned \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Record-breaking\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Successful, great\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Forward-thinking\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Progressive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Time-saving\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Efficient, concise\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Good-looking\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Attractive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Well-known\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Renowned, famous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Easy-going\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Outgoing, extrovert\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Of course. They're a bit old-fashioned if you ask me."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Well, that's very eye-opening. I thought that using those tools was one of the toughest parts of moving to a digital format."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "brochure"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a printed or digital catalogue or pamphlet."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm trying to attract more clients, but these brochures aren't working."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n4le02ob02aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "old-fashioned "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "vintage, outdated or old."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They're a bit old-fashioned if you ask me."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n4le02ob02aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "web authoring "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "something that allows people to develop websites."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Here we can install this great web authoring and photo editing program."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n4le02ob02aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "layout "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "design or outline."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: As you can see it allows us to use different layout tools\u2026"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n4le02ob02aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "blurry"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "difficult to see or unclear."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Though the colors might not match, and it might look a little blurry."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n4le02ob02aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "post "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to publish or issue."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: And we can post it in the most popular and coolest websites to attract more 