ng-lasting impression with a nice website.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span>: I don't know how to do that. Can you help me?</div>"}, {"time": "24000", "image": "enpe8n4le02ob02re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<div align=\"justify\"><span class=\"strong\">Sharon</span>: Sure. Sometimes the hardest part is moving information from a physical format to a digital one. However, with the right tools, you'll see it's the easiest thing you can do.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span>: What do I need, then?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sharon</span>: Let's use your laptop. Here we can install this great web authoring and photo editing program. As you can see it allows us to use different layout tools, animations, banners, sounds and even videos.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span>: Well, that's very eye-opening. I thought that using those tools was one of the toughest parts of moving to a digital format.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sharon</span>:  It can be. However, one of the advantages of creating web content is that you can have a far-reaching audience, compared to that of printed brochures. Also, developing these tools is less time-consuming than printing anything.</div>"}, {"time": "82000", "image": "enpe8n4le02ob02re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<div align=\"justify\"><span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span>: Can we transfer the brochure into a digital format?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sharon</span>: Sure! We need to scan it and make it even better. Though the colors might not match, and it might look a little blurry, but you know, that's one of the disadvantages of converting from a printed format to a digital one.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span>: Can we fix that?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sharon</span>: Definitely, we'll make the prettiest animation using all the tools in this program. And we can post it in the most popular and coolest websites to attract more customers.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span>: Sure, let's do it!</div>"}], "coverimg": "enpe8n4le02ob02re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "type": "scholar"}]}